                                                "sense_id": "4c883dfb-601c-3900-96bf-ae9dd05f5949",
                                                "text": "Likewise, the menopause market is obsessed with muscle wastage, and the possibility that if women don't eat enough protein after the age of 40 their minds will go doolally and their bones will turn to dust."
